{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43593","headline":"游长安诸寺联句 长乐坊安国寺 穗柏联句 · 段成式","name":"游长安诸寺联句 长乐坊安国寺 穗柏联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一院暑难侵，莓苔共影深。\n标枝争息鸟，余吹正开襟。\n宿雨香添色，残阳石在阴。\n乘闲动诗意，助静入禅心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"段成式","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43593.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43593","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}